# HYDRA Direct Background App Execution Engine (HDBE)
## Comprehensive Phase-by-Phase Implementation Roadmap

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Core Objective**: Enable HYDRA to execute tasks for all connected apps (checking unread emails, reading Classroom assignments, playing music, sending messages) **100% in the background** without opening browser tabs or interrupting the user's screen. The connection process is engineered for everyday users with **zero technical knowledge** (no developer consoles, no API keys, no complicated configs).

